    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "专题 1 周期信号三角形式傅里叶级数",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            310,
            109,
            685,
            129
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点 1: Sa函数及在 FT 中的应用",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            140,
            497,
            157
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "抽样信号，Sa函数是非常重要的连续信号之一，在FT中使用频繁，在此补充Sa函数的定义与使用。",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            168,
            813,
            209
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、定义： $Sa(t)=\\frac{sin(t)}{t}$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            217,
            374,
            241
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、图形：",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            247,
            265,
            264
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/9b07dff0c088771ce912771a2c4eeaf74b80de2c6c8fd8d4f7c5cbe2b2f513ff.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            354,
            277,
            631,
            378
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、特点：",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            385,
            263,
            401
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1)偶对称: $Sa(-t) = Sa(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            409,
            406,
            427
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2)收敛性",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            434,
            270,
            451
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3)过零点： $Sa(t)=0\\Rightarrow\\frac{sin t}{t}=0\\Rightarrow sin t=0$ 且 $t\\neq0\\Rightarrow t=k\\pi,\\quad k=\\pm1,\\quad\\pm2$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            458,
            805,
            480
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(4)第一过零点: $\\pi$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            489,
            337,
            505
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(5)积分性质",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            513,
            287,
            530
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} S a (t) d t = \\pi ; \\int_ {0} ^ {\\infty} S a (t) d t = \\frac {\\pi}{2}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            357,
            535,
            640,
            571
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4、构造过程",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            578,
            292,
            593
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1)构造Sa函数；",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            603,
            315,
            618
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{c} \\frac {\\sin 2 t}{t} = \\\\ \\frac {\\sin 5 0 0 \\pi t}{t} = \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            447,
            625,
            547,
            694
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2)构造后 Sa 函数图形",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            699,
            369,
            714
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "以 $2Sa(2t)$ 为例，幅值最高点仍在 t=0 处，最大幅值为 2，过零点为 $\\sin 2t = 0$ 且 $t \\neq 0$ ，即 $t = \\frac{k\\pi}{2}$ ， $k = \\pm 1, \\pm 2, \\cdots$ ，第一过零点为 $t = \\frac{\\pi}{2}$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            723,
            811,
            771
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
        "text": "2",
        "bbox": [
            936,
            967,
            952,
            980
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
        "text": "1",
        "bbox": [
            492,
            856,
            504,
            866
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
