    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点3：余弦形式的傅里叶级数",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            109,
            482,
            128
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "两者关系",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            315,
            263,
            332
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf (t) = c _ {0} + \\sum_ {n = 1} ^ {\\infty} c _ {n} \\cdot \\cos \\left(n \\omega_ {1} t + \\varphi_ {n}\\right)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            349,
            264,
            631,
            309
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\na _ {0} = c _ {0}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            465,
            342,
            531,
            357
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nc _ {n} = \\sqrt {a _ {n} ^ {2} + b _ {n} ^ {2}} (c _ {n} \\mathrm{永远是正值}), n \\geq 1\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            354,
            364,
            640,
            384
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\na _ {n} = c _ {n} \\cos \\varphi_ {n}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            438,
            391,
            557,
            409
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nb _ {n} = - c _ {n} \\sin \\varphi_ {n}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            435,
            414,
            561,
            433
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\tan \\varphi_ {n} = - \\frac {b _ {n}}{a _ {n}}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            440,
            437,
            557,
            470
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n(n = 1, 2, \\dots)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            448,
            476,
            551,
            492
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、三角形式下频谱的定义",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            498,
            398,
            514
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1)频谱包含幅度谱与相位谱，其中幅度谱为 $C_{n}\\sim n\\omega_{1}$ ，相位谱 $\\varphi_{n}\\sim n\\omega_{1}$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            522,
            744,
            539
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "chart",
        "img_path": "images/6099360c24868c2f02928b7a877f9e0d86f46cd5faf12c72bc94bc53a8ccd58c.jpg",
        "content": "",
        "chart_caption": [
