    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、周期信号的频谱画法(余弦形式视角下)",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            108,
            522,
            125
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1)将(不规范的)周期信号傅里叶级数整理成余弦形式傅里叶级数；",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            133,
            705,
            149
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} {s i n   \\theta = c o s \\left(\\theta - \\frac {\\pi}{2}\\right)} \\\\ {-   c o s   \\theta = c o s   (\\theta \\pm \\pi)} \\end{array} \\right. \\Rightarrow C _ {0} + \\sum_ {n = 1} ^ {\\infty} c _ {n}   c o s   (n \\omega_ {1} t + \\varphi_ {n})   \\text {且} C _ {n}   \\text {正}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            260,
            156,
            732,
            201
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2)明确各频率分量对应的值: 幅度谱为 $C_{n} \\sim n \\omega_{1}$ , 相位谱 $\\varphi_{n} \\sim n \\omega_{1}$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            206,
            709,
            223
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3)画幅度谱和相位谱。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            232,
            369,
            248
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【以下新增，同一下次课例题】",
        "bbox": [
